/**
 * @defgroup RoModular_Governance Governance
 * @brief Status, documentation ownership, and shared operating rules across the ecosystem.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup RoModular_Governance_Status Repository Status
 * @ingroup RoModular_Governance
 * @brief Maturity definitions and the current ecosystem snapshot.
 *
 * @section RoModularStatusDefinitions Status Definitions
 *
 * | Status | Meaning |
 * | ------ | ------- |
 * | Stable | Published contract with repeatable validation and release evidence |
 * | Active | Under development with an explicit contract and acceptance plan |
 * | Planned | Intended repository or relationship not yet validated |
 * | Legacy | Retained as reference; current compatibility is not promised |
 * | Archived | No active development and no compatibility commitment |
 *
 * @section RoModularCurrentStatus Current Snapshot
 *
 * | Repository | Status | Next ecosystem milestone |
 * | ---------- | ------ | ------------------------ |
 * | RoModular | Active | Publish and maintain the ecosystem portal |
 * | RoModularBuild | Active | Stabilize the shared profiles already consumed by Foundation and MCC |
 * | CPSTL | Stable | Released 1.1.12; preserve portable C++11 and embedded validation |
 * | Foundation | Stable | Tagged 2.0.10 on CPSTL 1.1.12 |
 * | DspCore | Active | Released 0.1.3; now requires Foundation 2.0.10; continue the signal-processing plan |
 * | MusicCompositionCore | Stable | Released 0.6.2; now requires Foundation 2.0.10 |
 * | MIDILAR | Stable | Released 0.3.3 with calibrated MIDI clock support |
 * | RoModularCLI | Planned | Begin the JDX-style orchestration tool only after the ecosystem and multiplatform bootstrap are stable |
 *
 * @section RoModularDocumentationOwnership Documentation Ownership
 *
 * When a repository changes its API, supported platform, package contract, or
 * release status, that repository must update its own documentation in the
 * same change. This portal is updated only when the ecosystem-level summary,
 * dependency map, status, or navigation link changes.
 */
